          "content": "**Figure it Out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.224,
            0.881,
            0.259
          ],
          "content": "**Q.1. What would you do to find the most popular game among Naresh’s and Navya’s classmates?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.269,
            0.883,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** One of the ways could be to arrange and organize the given data in a table. Think of some other ways."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.314,
            0.557,
            0.332
          ],
          "content": "**Q.2. What is the most popular game in their class?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.342,
            0.38,
            0.359
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** Hockey (frequency – 8)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.369,
            0.882,
            0.422
          ],
          "content": "**Q.4. Pari wants to respond to the questions given below. Put a tick (** ) for the questions **where she needs to carry out data collection and put a cross** (⨉**) for the questions where she doesn’t need to collect data. Discuss your answers in the classroom.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.431,
            0.864,
            0.502
          ],
          "content": "**a. What is the most popular TV show among her classmates?** □ **b. When did India get independence? c. How much water is getting wasted in her locality? d. What is the capital of India?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.518,
            0.265,
            0.544
          ],
          "content": "**Ans.** a."
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.546,
            0.265,
            0.575
          ],
          "content": "b . ^ { [ \\underline { { x } } ] }",
          "image_source": "images/page_33_equation_12.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.578,
            0.265,
            0.601
          ],
          "content": "c \\square",
          "image_source": "images/page_33_equation_13.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
